2	// live head-to-head with three metrics to race on — throughput (cumulative
3	// successful ops), latency (rolling p50, lower wins), and reliability
4	// (success rate). Every number shown is measured, and a methodology caption
5	// built from the run's actual workload says exactly what is being watched.
6	// State derives entirely from the event stream, so a finished run replays
7	// straight to its final standings.
